<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Twas grace that wrote my name</l><l>In life’s eternal book;</l><l>’Twas grace that gave me to the Lamb,</l><l>Who all my sorrows took.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Grace taught my wandering feet</l><l>To tread the pilgrim road;</l><l>And new supplies each hour I meet</l><l>While pressing on to God.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Grace taught my heart to pray,</l><l>And made my eyes o’erflow;</l><l>’Tis grace which kept me to this day,</l><l>And will not let me go.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Grace all the work shall crown</l><l>Through everlasting days;</l><l>It lays in love the topmost stone,</l><l>And well deserves the praise.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Oh, let that grace inspire</l><l>My heart with strength divine;</l><l>May all my powers to Thee aspire,</l><l>And all my days be Thine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
